# desc: 층에서 실을 거쳐 센서에 이르는 경로는 무엇인가? — 공간 계층과 계측 어휘가 만나는 공유 경로
# suite: core
# shared: true
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX brick: <https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#>
PREFIX rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?floor ?room ?sensor
WHERE {
  ?floor a/rdfs:subClassOf* brick:Floor .
  ?floor brick:hasPart|^brick:isPartOf ?room .
  ?room brick:isLocationOf|^brick:hasLocation ?sensor .
  ?sensor a ?sensorClass .
  ?sensorClass rdfs:subClassOf* brick:Sensor .
}
ORDER BY ?floor ?room ?sensor
